i GPS</label><div class="as-input-group"><input type="number" min="10" max="1000" step="1" wire:model.live.debounce.250ms="maximumAccuracyMeters" class="as-input"><span class="as-input-suffix">meter</span></div><p class="as-field-help">Batas ketelitian posisi GPS perangkat saat presensi.</p></div></div></section>

